# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and fill in.
# Yandex Maps JS API 2.1 key from https://developer.tech.yandex.ru/ (product: "JavaScript API и HTTP Геокодер").
# When set, the address picker uses Yandex Maps + Yandex geocoder; when empty, it falls back to OpenStreetMap/Leaflet.
VITE_YANDEX_MAPS_API_KEY=
